* END-HISTORY
*
*
* START-DESCRIPTION:
*
*   CALL !TESTLOCK(lock.number, owner)
*
* OWNER is the user number that holds task lock LOCK.NUMBER (0 to 63), or 0
* if it is free.  A lock number outside 0 to 63 stops the program as LOCK
* would.
*
* END-DESCRIPTION
*
* START-CODE

$internal
$no.xref
subroutine testlck(lock.number, owner)
$catalog !TESTLOCK

   owner = testlock(lock.number)
   return
end

* END-CODE
